---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="A practical note-taking guide"
  description="A small workflow for turning research into reusable notes without endless browsing."
>

  <section class="section">
    <h1>A practical note-taking guide.</h1>
    <p>This is a short workflow, not a productivity system. It is meant for days when you want to learn something, use it, and move on.</p>
    <p>The goal is not to collect more links. The goal is to leave a trace you can actually reuse.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>Workflow</h2>
    <div class="list">
      <div class="list-item card card-raised card-interactive">
        <p class="card-title">Step 1: Pick one goal</p>
        <p class="card-body">Write the smallest version of what you want to learn or build. If it fits on one sticky note, it is real.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="list-item card card-raised card-interactive">
        <p class="card-title">Step 2: Collect three useful sources</p>
        <p class="card-body">One clear explanation, one example, one source you can cite if someone asks where it came from.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="list-item card card-raised card-interactive">
        <p class="card-title">Step 3: Extract one reusable action</p>
        <p class="card-body">Not a summary. An action you would repeat next week. If there is no action, delete the note.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="list-item card card-raised card-interactive">
        <p class="card-title">Step 4: Make it easy to reuse</p>
        <p class="card-body">Add a title, one example, one check, and one source link. Later, you will thank yourself.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>Examples</h2>
    <div class="grid-3">
      <div class="card card-raised card-interactive">
        <p class="card-title">Noisy morning</p>
        <p class="card-body">Use a 5-minute starter: one drink of water, one task, one notification block. No big plan.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card card-raised card-interactive">
        <p class="card-title">Repeated search</p>
        <p class="card-body">Save the exact phrase, the best source, and the step you used. Next time, open your note first.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card card-raised card-interactive">
        <p class="card-title">Learning in public</p>
        <p class="card-body">Share one sentence about what you changed and one result. That is enough to stay accountable.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section callout">
    <p class="card-body callout-lead">If you want, next step is the about page, where this project and its limits are stated plainly.</p>
    <p class="section-cta">
      <a href="/about/" class="link-underline">Read the about page -></a>
    </p>
  </section>

  <style>
    .section + .section {
      margin-top: 2.75rem;
    }
    .section h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.5vw, 2.8rem);
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--color-navy);
      margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
      line-height: 1.1;
    }
    .section h2 {
      color: var(--color-navy);
      margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
    }
    .section p {
      color: var(--color-ink-muted);
    }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
